# Copy to `spikes/.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.
# Both are optional: without them spikes 1, 2, 3 and 5 run unchanged, spike 4
# falls back to measured tokens x the published rate, and spike 6 cannot create
# its gateway. Every RESULT.md says which measurements it could not take.

# Dashboard -> Workers & Pages -> Account ID in the right sidebar,
# or run: npx wrangler whoami
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=

# Dashboard -> My Profile -> API Tokens -> Create Token -> Create Custom Token.
# Two permissions, both on Account:
#   Account Analytics : Read   (spike 4 reads billed neurons from GraphQL)
#   AI Gateway        : Edit   (spike 6 creates the gateway it tests)
# Shown once at creation. Delete the token when week 1 is done.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
